        {
          "name": "whats_new",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:3cf170f81d8fed3a494ee874b64de9c0058d49d262d84d9434ee9b44776d7c78",
          "description": "Polling-friendly catalog diff. Body { since?, limit? } (default since=now-24h, limit=200, max 500). Returns added_endpoints[] (first_seen_at >= since AND is_active=true), removed_endpoints[] (flipped to is_active=false since), service-level counts, polls_in_window, and current active totals. Cheap ($0.001 USDC) so hourly polling stays under $1/month — perfect for aggregator agents that need a fresh delta without re-pulling the whole catalog. Internal ingest cron runs every 5 min, so polling more often than that returns identical data.",
